      <Docs>
        <summary>Constant for importance: This process is running something that is actively visible to the user, though not in the immediate foreground.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Constant for importance: This process is running something that is actively visible to the user, though not in the immediate foreground. This may be running a window that is behind the current foreground (so paused and with its state saved, not interacting with the user, but visible to them to some degree); it may also be running other services under the system's control that it considers important.</para>
